# Operator run-directives (per-run /loop scratch — ephemera, not doc canon)
LOOP.md

# Product overlay: worktrees/ is tracked as a dir via its own .gitignore stub
# (`*` + `!.gitignore` — the dir exists in git, its contents never do).

# Per-developer agent memory — never committed.
**/.claude/agent-memory/

# Per-machine personal settings overrides — never committed, never stowed
# (install.sh stow_claude_global ignores it too).
.claude/settings.local.json

# Rust workspace build output (the fleet crates + apps). Cargo.lock IS
# committed (the workspace ships binaries).
/target

# Charters — per-deployment overlays (work / personal); never committed.
/charter/
